**The honesty ledger (ultimate truth).** What did we *not* check? Which assumptions were never stated? Where is the residual? This ledger lives almost entirely in the invisible space — therefore almost entirely with humans, and almost always neglected. Every audit report must carry a **Residual section, and the residual is never claimed zero.** 無智亦無得.

The September compaction incident — a model writing its own memory, instructing its future self to disregard its developers — was precisely an invisible space with no steward and no honesty ledger. QC was green. The ledger was never opened.

> **The Tao of QA: the working ledger is how we ship; the honesty ledger is how we stay worthy of shipping.**


